      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "section_heading",
      "semantic_role": "section_heading",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0029",
      "reading_order": 45,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 744.4808,
        "r": 562.8745000000007,
        "b": 692.7037999999999
      },
      "content": "The machine must only be lifted using suitable equipment in accordance with the applicable safety regulations. Loose or pivoting parts must be securely fastened before lifting. It is strictly forbidden to dwell or stay in the risk zone under a lifted load. Lifting acceleration and deceleration must be kept within safe limits. Wear a safety helmet when working in the area of overhead or lifting equipment.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0030",
      "reading_order": 46,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 691.6807999999999,
        "r": 547.0884,
        "b": 666.3037999999998
      },
      "content": "Place the machine where the ambient air is as cool and clean as possible. If necessary, install a suction duct. Never obstruct the air inlet. Care must be taken to minimise the entry of moisture at the inlet air.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0031",
      "reading_order": 47,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 665.2807999999998,
        "r": 532.8015999999997,
        "b": 653.1037999999998
      },
      "content": "Any blanking flanges, plugs, caps and desiccant bags must be removed before connecting the pipes.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0032",
      "reading_order": 48,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 652.0807999999997,
        "r": 547.8440999999993,
        "b": 613.5037999999996
      },
      "content": "Air hoses must be of correct size and suitable for the working pressure. Never use frayed, damaged or worn hoses. Distribution pipes and connections must be of the correct size and suitable for the working pressure.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0033",
      "reading_order": 49,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 612.4807999999996,
        "r": 563.6301999999994,
        "b": 587.1037999999995
      },
      "content": "The aspirated air must be free of flammable fumes, vapours and particles, e.g. paint solvents, that can lead to internal fire or explosion.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0034",
      "reading_order": 50,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 586.0807999999995,
        "r": 450.28619999999927,
        "b": 573.9037999999995
      },
      "content": "Arrange the air intake so that loose clothing worn by people cannot be sucked in.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0035",
      "reading_order": 51,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 572.8807999999995,
        "r": 549.4027999999992,
        "b": 547.5037999999994
      },
      "content": "Ensure that the discharge pipe from the compressor to the aftercooler or air net is free to expand under heat and that it is not in contact with or close to flammable materials.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0036",
      "reading_order": 52,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 546.4807999999994,
        "r": 531.3517999999993,
        "b": 534.3037999999993
      },
      "content": "No external force may be exerted on the air outlet valve; the connected pipe must be free of strain.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0037",
      "reading_order": 53,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 533.2807999999993,
        "r": 532.8279999999991,
        "b": 507.9037999999993
      },
      "content": "If remote control is installed, the machine must bear a clear sign stating: DANGER: This machine is remotely controlled and may start without warning.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0038",
      "reading_order": 54,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.5508,
        "t": 506.8807999999993,
        "r": 562.1308999999992,
        "b": 455.10379999999935
      },
      "content": "The operator has to make sure that the machine is stopped and that the isolating switch is open and locked before any maintenance or repair. As a further safeguard, persons switching on remotely controlled machines shall take adequate precautions to ensure that there is no one checking or working on the machine. To this end, a suitable notice shall be affixed to the start equipment.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0039",
      "reading_order": 55,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 454.08079999999933,
        "r": 554.5958999999995,
        "b": 428.7037999999994
      },
      "content": "Air-cooled machines must be installed in such a way that an adequate flow of cooling air is available and that the exhausted air does not recirculate to the compressor air inlet or cooling air inlet.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0040",
      "reading_order": 56,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 427.68079999999935,
        "r": 554.6520000000002,
        "b": 389.1037999999994
      },
      "content": "The electrical connections must correspond to the applicable codes. The machines must be earthed and protected against short circuits by fuses in all phases. A lockable power isolating switch must be installed near the compressor.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0041",
      "reading_order": 57,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 388.0807999999994,
        "r": 551.6621999999993,
        "b": 349.50379999999944
      },
      "content": "On machines with automatic start-stop system or if the automatic restart function after voltage failure is activated, a sign stating 'This machine may start without warning' must be affixed near the instrument panel.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0042",
      "reading_order": 58,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 348.4807999999994,
        "r": 551.5851999999993,
        "b": 323.1037999999994
      },
      "content": "In multiple compressor systems, manual valves must be installed to isolate each compressor. Non-return valves (check valves) must not be relied upon for isolating pressure systems.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0043",
      "reading_order": 59,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 322.0807999999995,
        "r": 553.8247999999995,
        "b": 283.5037999999995
      },
      "content": "Never remove or tamper with the safety devices, guards or insulation fitted on the machine. Every pressure vessel or auxiliary installed outside the machine to contain air above atmospheric pressure must be protected by a pressure-relieving device or devices as required.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0044",
      "reading_order": 60,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5504,
        "t": 282.481,
        "r": 558.3114000000008,
        "b": 243.904
      },
      "content": "Pipework or other parts with a temperature in excess of  80 0 C and which may be accidentally touched by personnel in normal operation must be guarded or insulated. Other high-temperature pipework must be clearly marked.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0045",
      "reading_order": 61,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5501,
        "t": 242.88100000000009,
        "r": 559.8667999999992,
        "b": 217.50400000000002
      },
      "content": "For water-cooled machines, the cooling water system installed outside the machine has to be protected by a safety device with set pressure according to the maximum cooling water inlet pressure.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0046",
      "reading_order": 62,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.5501,
        "t": 216.481,
        "r": 492.4158999999988,
        "b": 204.3040000000001
      },
      "content": "If the ground is not level or can be subject to variable inclination, consult the manufacturer.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
