    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0047",
      "reading_order": 64,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.3099,
        "t": 188.16150000000005,
        "r": 516.0345,
        "b": 162.784
      },
      "content": "Also consult following safety precautions: Safety precautions during operation and Safety precautions during maintenance.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0048",
      "reading_order": 65,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.31,
        "t": 161.76099999999997,
        "r": 511.58899999999915,
        "b": 123.18399999999997
      },
      "content": "These precautions apply to machinery processing or consuming air or inert gas. Processing of any other gas requires additional safety precautions typical to the application which are not included herein.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1       Safety precautions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_44",
          "title": "Precautions during installation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 9,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0049",
      "reading_order": 66,
      "section": "Precautions during installation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.31,
        "t": 122.16100000000006,
        "r": 556.5395000000001,
        "b": 96.0041
      },
      "content": "Some precautions are general and cover several machine types and equipment; hence some statements may not apply to your machine.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_44",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
